## Common Patterns

### Create a GitHub repo
```bash
gh repo create {{GITHUB_ORG}}/REPO_NAME --private --description "DESCRIPTION"
```

### Push an existing git repo to GitHub
```bash
cd /path/to/repo
git remote add origin https://github.com/{{GITHUB_ORG}}/REPO_NAME.git
git branch -M main
git push -u origin main
```

### SSH to Droplet (once provisioned)
```bash
DROPLET_IP=$(doctl compute droplet list --format "Name,PublicIPv4" --no-header | grep {{PRODUCT_SLUG}}-api | awk '{print $2}')
ssh -i ~/.ssh/id_ed25519 -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no root@$DROPLET_IP 'command here'
```

### Set Vercel env var
```bash
echo "https://{{API_DOMAIN}}" | vercel env add API_BASE_URL production
```

### Update prd.json story to passing
```bash
PARENT="{{WORKING_DIR}}"
jq --arg id "US-XXX" '(.stories[] | select(.id == $id) | .passes) |= true' "$PARENT/prd.json" > "$PARENT/prd.tmp" && mv "$PARENT/prd.tmp" "$PARENT/prd.json"
```

